nchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A drawing is coordinates and nothing else. It holds no sizes, shapes, labels or styles;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering is the caller’s. A layout lists its graph’s vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"units are its own: separation 1 for tree and layered drawings, the optimal distance for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Fruchterman–Reingold, edge lengths for stress majorization. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rescaled(scale:center:)"},{"type":"text","text":" maps any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drawing to a common frame."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The drawing is a random-access collection of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(vertex, position)"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs in order, indexed by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offset. Look a vertex up with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" (traps when absent) or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position(checked:)"},{"type":"text","text":" (throws),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and move it with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setPosition(_:of:)"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"type":"text","text":" is the whole column, for loops in index"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"space. Lookup is the offset itself when the vertices are the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<n"},{"type":"text","text":" in order, and one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hash otherwise."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two drawings are equal when they list the same vertices with the same positions in the same","type":"text"},{"te